<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Ignore</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>ignore &lt;player&gt;    stop hearing their tells
ignore &lt;player&gt;    (again) hear them again
ignore             list the players you ignore
</pre>
<p>Example:
</p>
<pre>ignore Spammer
</pre>
<p>Ignore stops a player's tells and responses from reaching you. They are 
told that you ignore them. You still see everything else they do: what 
they say in the room, and what they write on channels and shouts.
</p><p>The player must be online when you add them, and only players can be 
ignored, up to 100 at a time. Your list is kept with your character.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Tell</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Respond</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Comm</a>
</pre>




</div>